==Finnish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fi|urj-fin-pro|*toores}}, of {{der|fi|bat}} origin (compare {{cog|lt|dõras||good}}), with the suffix {{m|fi|-e}}. The same reshaping has been applied in {{cog|krl|tuoreh}} and {{cog|vot|toorõh}}. {{cog|et|toores}} retains the original stem type.

